---
title: Sequence Diagram — Autonomous Agent Banking (SSE · MCP · EIP-7702)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Retail Client
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API (SSE)
    participant CTX as Context Assembly<br/>(3-tier prompt)
    participant QW as Qwen3-8B
    participant MW as Confirmation Middleware
    participant MCP as MCP Tool Server<br/>(17 tools)
    participant SK as EIP-7702 Session Key
    participant SC as LocalBank Contract
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: User message (action intent)
    FE->>API: POST /agent/stream (SSE open)
    API->>CTX: Inject Stable + Context + Volatile tiers
    CTX->>DB: Read SESSIONS · account state · SBT
    DB-->>CTX: JSON context snapshot
    CTX->>QW: System prompt + user message
    QW->>QW: Classify Q&A vs action request

    alt Q&A path (read-only)
        QW->>MCP: get_requirements / get_credit_score
        MCP-->>QW: Tool result
        QW-->>API: Grounded reply (no write)
        API-->>FE: SSE token stream
        FE-->>U: Answer with citations
    else Action path (write tool)
        QW-->>API: Confirmation summary<br/>"150 USDC · 6 mo · 26.25 USDC/mo"
        API-->>FE: SSE confirmation prompt
        FE-->>U: "Shall I proceed?"
        U->>FE: Affirmative consent
        FE->>API: POST write-tool (confirmed)
        API->>MW: Audit hook — verify confirmation turn
        alt No confirmation in CHAT_MESSAGE
            MW-->>API: HTTP 403 Forbidden
            API->>DB: INSERT agent_action_log (rejected)
            API-->>U: Action blocked
        else Confirmation verified
            MW->>MCP: submit_loan_application (WRITE)
            MCP->>API: POST /api/loan/apply
            API->>SK: Sign within scope<br/>(500 USDC cap · 24h TTL)
            SK->>SC: UserOperation / tx
            SC-->>API: emit LoanApplied
            API->>DB: INSERT agent_action_log<br/>(tool_name · confirmation_turn_id · tx_hash)
            API-->>FE: SSE status update
            FE-->>U: "Application submitted · L-4821"
        end
    end
